{"id":"js-fundamentos-estructuras-de-control-condicionales","title":"JS - Fundamentos - Estructuras de Control Condicionales","topic":"javascript","topicLabel":"JavaScript","tags":["aprendizaje","javascript","fundamentos"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"},{"depth":3,"text":"1. Condicional if / else if / else","id":"1-condicional-if-else-if-else"},{"depth":3,"text":"2. Estructura switch (Importante incluir break en cada caso)","id":"2-estructura-switch-importante-incluir-break-en-cada-caso"},{"depth":3,"text":"3. Operador Ternario","id":"3-operador-ternario"},{"depth":3,"text":"4. Condicionales Anidados","id":"4-condicionales-anidados"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":4,"words":196,"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Las <strong>estructuras de control condicionales</strong> son instrucciones que permiten bifurcar el flujo de ejecución de un programa. Sirven para tomar decisiones en el código: si se cumple una condición, el programa ejecuta un bloque de instrucciones determinado; si no se cumple, ejecuta otro o simplemente continúa.</p>\n<p>Disponemos de:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>if</code>: Ejecuta código si una condición es verdadera.</li>\n<li><code>else</code>: Define un camino alternativo si la condición del <code>if</code> es falsa.</li>\n<li><code>else if</code>: Permite evaluar múltiples condiciones encadenadas en orden.</li>\n<li><code>switch</code>: Ideal para elegir entre múltiples caminos fijos basándose en un único valor específico.</li>\n<li><strong>Operador Ternario:</strong> Una forma compacta de escribir un condicional <code>if-else</code> en una sola línea.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><h3 id=\"1-condicional-if-else-if-else\" class=\"note__h\">1. Condicional <code>if</code> / <code>else if</code> / <code>else</code></h3><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> temperatura = <span class=\"hljs-number\">26</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (temperatura &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">30</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Hace mucho calor.&quot;</span>);\n} <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (temperatura &gt;= <span class=\"hljs-number\">20</span> &amp;&amp; temperatura &lt;= <span class=\"hljs-number\">30</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;El clima está templado.&quot;</span>); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Se ejecuta este bloque</span>\n} <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Hace frío.&quot;</span>);\n}</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-estructura-switch-importante-incluir-break-en-cada-caso\" class=\"note__h\">2. Estructura <code>switch</code> (Importante incluir <code>break</code> en cada caso)</h3><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> diaSemana = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Lunes&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">switch</span> (diaSemana) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">case</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Lunes&quot;</span>:\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Inicio de semana laborable.&quot;</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">break</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">case</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Sábado&quot;</span>:\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">case</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Domingo&quot;</span>:\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;¡Fin de semana!&quot;</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">break</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">default</span>:\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Día de diario.&quot;</span>);\n}</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-operador-ternario\" class=\"note__h\">3. Operador Ternario</h3><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Sintaxis: condicion ? valor_si_verdadero : valor_si_falso;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> edad = <span class=\"hljs-number\">20</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> tipoAcceso = (edad &gt;= <span class=\"hljs-number\">18</span>) ? <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Adulto&quot;</span> : <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Menor de edad&quot;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(tipoAcceso); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &quot;Adulto&quot;</span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"4-condicionales-anidados\" class=\"note__h\">4. Condicionales Anidados</h3><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> tieneCuenta = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> cuentaActiva = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (tieneCuenta) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (cuentaActiva) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Acceso concedido al panel.&quot;</span>);\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Tu cuenta está suspendida.&quot;</span>);\n  }\n} <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Por favor, regístrate primero.&quot;</span>);\n}</code></pre></div>"}